    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11073" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cōpa</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cūpa</span></b> ), ae, f.
		copo = caupo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a female tavern-keeper and castanet-dancer</i>, who
			exhibited her arts in her ale-house (cf. crotalum),
					<i><span class="en">Verg. Cop. 1</span></i> Heyne and Wagner: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">matronae copas imitantes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Ner. 27</span></i>
			.</div>
